# Bundled per-game compatibility profiles.
#
# Games that work with the global defaults are not listed here. Add a profile
# only when one title needs behavior that cannot be the default; general fixes
# belong in the CompatFeature defaults so every game benefits.
#
# To add one:
#   1. Create profiles/<id>.properties.
#   2. Add <id> below.
#   3. Match on JAM metadata, not the user's filename:
#        appclass:<AppClass>         jar:<PackageURL jar base>
#        jarname:<resolved jar base> cp:<CPName>
#        name:<AppName>              ver:<AppVer>
#        apid:<TrustedAPID>          sha256:<exact JAM sha-256>
#        key:<appclass>/<jar>
#      Fingerprints in one match.N block are ANDed; blocks are ORed.
#
# Removing an id disables its overrides.

kh-coded-side-episode
